// PARAM: --analysis sign
// Same program as 00-sanity/01-straight_line_proved.vimp, under Sign
// instead of Interval. Locks in the fix for #99: the generic D/G unit
// bridge (unit_step_st/unit_step_for) now reconstructs state through
// combine_abs, routing each name to the component that owns it, instead of
// a raw lattice join against the other component's Top default. A purely
// local write no longer loses precision through the global slot.
void main() {
  x := 5;
  __voblint_check(0 < x) // PROVED
}
